  "content": "\n\n<div>《村民暮光 Lite》整合包是一款《煩人的村民》整合包。</div>\n<div>它引入了大量來自《煩人的村民》的角色、技能與特效，讓你能在 Minecraft 中體驗《煩人的村民》的激烈戰鬥。</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>官方網站</div>\n<div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvillager-dusk.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://villager-dusk.github.io/</a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>遊戲影片</div>\n<div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MSBOtjcZDkM\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div>",
